{"seq":2,"slug":"exoplanet-atmospheres","title":"系外行星大气表征：JWST 时代的光谱革命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/exoplanet-atmospheres","wordCount":2283,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"系外行星大气表征-jwst-时代的光谱革命\">系外行星大气表征：JWST 时代的光谱革命</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>系外行星大气表征是将系外行星从&quot;质量和半径的数据点&quot;转变为&quot;有化学身份和气候状态的真实世界&quot;的关键步骤。通过分析行星大气中分子的吸收和发射特征，我们可以推断其化学组成、温度结构、云层特性甚至动力学过程。JWST 的发射（2021年12月）和运行标志着这一领域的革命性突破，首次将系外行星大气光谱从&quot;检测到分子&quot;推进到&quot;精确定量化学&quot;的阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>系外行星大气表征把光谱信号翻译为化学与气候状态，其核心是几类观测几何与逆问题方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应本文</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>透射光谱</td>\n<td>凌星时大气边缘吸收恒星光，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 给出成分与云</td>\n<td>透射光谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气标高</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=k_BT/\\mu g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">μg</span></span></span></span></span> 决定信号强弱，热巨行星比类地行星易测百倍</td>\n<td>透射光谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次食光谱</td>\n<td>行星被遮挡时的亮度差含其热辐射，反映日面温度与成分</td>\n<td>二次食</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相位曲线</td>\n<td>全轨道亮度变化映射经度温度分布与环流</td>\n<td>相位曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大气检索</td>\n<td>由光谱反演参数的逆问题，常用贝叶斯/MCMC 方法</td>\n<td>大气检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简并</td>\n<td>云-金属度、温度-丰度等简并使反演多解，需多波段互补</td>\n<td>简并挑战</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hycean 假说</td>\n<td>富氢大气下的全球海洋行星，K2-18b 是争议性候选</td>\n<td>K2-18b</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大气表征方法\">大气表征方法</h2><h3 id=\"凌星光谱学\">凌星光谱学</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[凌星光谱方法] --&gt; B[透射光谱]&#10;    A --&gt; C[热辐射/二次食光谱]&#10;    A --&gt; D[相位曲线]&#10;    B --&gt; E[行星从恒星前方经过]&#10;    B --&gt; F[大气边缘吸收恒星光]&#10;    B --&gt; G[得到: 大气成分 + 云/雾]&#10;    C --&gt; H[行星被恒星遮挡时亮度差]&#10;    C --&gt; I[得到: 日面大气温度 + 成分]&#10;    D --&gt; J[完整轨道亮度变化]&#10;    D --&gt; K[得到: 温度分布图 + 环流]\">flowchart TD\n    A[凌星光谱方法] --&gt; B[透射光谱]\n    A --&gt; C[热辐射/二次食光谱]\n    A --&gt; D[相位曲线]\n    B --&gt; E[行星从恒星前方经过]\n    B --&gt; F[大气边缘吸收恒星光]\n    B --&gt; G[得到: 大气成分 + 云/雾]\n    C --&gt; H[行星被恒星遮挡时亮度差]\n    C --&gt; I[得到: 日面大气温度 + 成分]\n    D --&gt; J[完整轨道亮度变化]\n    D --&gt; K[得到: 温度分布图 + 环流]</pre><h3 id=\"透射光谱原理\">透射光谱原理</h3><p>当行星凌星时，大气边缘处的分子吸收使行星在特定波长&quot;看起来更大&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta(\\lambda) = \\frac{R_p^2 + 2R_p H \\cdot N_H(\\lambda)}{R_\\star^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5202em;vertical-align:-0.933em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5872em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7731em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.933em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为大气标高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_H(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为等效吸收层数。</p>\n<p>大气标高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = \\frac{k_B T}{\\mu g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">μg</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数影响</th>\n<th>大标高(容易探测)</th>\n<th>小标高(困难)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>高温行星</td>\n<td>低温行星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均分子量</td>\n<td>H₂大气(μ=2)</td>\n<td>CO₂/N₂大气(μ=28-44)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重力</td>\n<td>低重力(小行星)</td>\n<td>高重力(超级地球)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云层</td>\n<td>无云</td>\n<td>高层云遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键启示：热巨行星(大H)比类地行星(小H)容易表征约100-1000倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"热辐射-二次食光谱\">热辐射/二次食光谱</h3><p>当行星被恒星遮挡时（二次食/secondary eclipse），系统总光减少了行星本身的热辐射贡献：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>λ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>λ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{planet}/F_{star} \\approx (R_p/R_\\star)^2 \\cdot B_\\lambda(T_p)/B_\\lambda(T_\\star)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1502em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1757em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1757em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋆</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于典型热木星（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p \\sim 1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span> K），行星/恒星对比度在中红外可达 ~10⁻³。</p>\n<h3 id=\"相位曲线\">相位曲线</h3><p>观测行星完整一周轨道的亮度变化，可构建经度方向的温度分布图：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相位曲线信息</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日夜温差</td>\n<td>大气热再分配效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热点偏移</td>\n<td>赤道超级旋转（急流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相位曲线振幅</td>\n<td>日面/夜面温度比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光谱相位曲线</td>\n<td>不同高度的环流模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"jwst-的大气表征能力\">JWST 的大气表征能力</h2><h3 id=\"仪器与模式\">仪器与模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仪器</th>\n<th>波长范围</th>\n<th>分辨率</th>\n<th>最佳应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NIRSpec (G395H)</td>\n<td>2.9–5.2 μm</td>\n<td>R~2700</td>\n<td>巨行星透射光谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NIRSpec (PRISM)</td>\n<td>0.6–5.3 μm</td>\n<td>R~100</td>\n<td>宽波段低分辨率概览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NIRISS (SOSS)</td>\n<td>0.6–2.8 μm</td>\n<td>R~700</td>\n<td>亮星高精度凌星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NIRCam (Grism)</td>\n<td>2.4–5.0 μm</td>\n<td>R~1600</td>\n<td>相位曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIRI (LRS)</td>\n<td>5–12 μm</td>\n<td>R~100</td>\n<td>热辐射/二次食</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"jwst-系外行星大气里程碑发现-2022-2025\">JWST 系外行星大气里程碑发现（2022-2025）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>发现</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WASP-39b</td>\n<td>热土星</td>\n<td>CO₂ 首次明确检测 (4.3μm)</td>\n<td>系外行星碳化学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASP-39b</td>\n<td>热土星</td>\n<td>SO₂ 光化学产物</td>\n<td>首次大气光化学证据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASP-107b</td>\n<td>温海王星</td>\n<td>SiO₂云+SO₂</td>\n<td>低质量行星大气化学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASP-17b</td>\n<td>热木星</td>\n<td>SiO₂(石英)云粒子</td>\n<td>云组成首次确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GJ 1214b</td>\n<td>亚海王星</td>\n<td>高金属度大气确认</td>\n<td>最具代表性的亚海王星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRAPPIST-1 b</td>\n<td>类地</td>\n<td>无厚H₂大气</td>\n<td>排除氢包层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRAPPIST-1 c</td>\n<td>类地</td>\n<td>极少/无大气</td>\n<td>CO₂大气也被排除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K2-18b</td>\n<td>亚海王星</td>\n<td>CH₄ + CO₂ (无CO)</td>\n<td>&quot;Hycean世界&quot;候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LHS 1140b</td>\n<td>超级地球</td>\n<td>可能的N₂大气信号</td>\n<td>宜居带岩石行星大气?</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"wasp-39b-jwst-的首个完整大气肖像\">WASP-39b: JWST 的首个完整大气肖像</h3><p>WASP-39b（ERS项目，2022年发表）展示了 JWST 的全部能力：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[WASP-39b 透射光谱] --&gt; B[检测到的分子]&#10;    A --&gt; C[推断的性质]&#10;    B --&gt; D[H₂O 多条吸收带]&#10;    B --&gt; E[CO₂ 4.3 μm 强吸收]&#10;    B --&gt; F[CO 弱信号]&#10;    B --&gt; G[SO₂ 光化学产物]&#10;    B --&gt; H[Na 可见光]&#10;    B --&gt; I[K 可见光]&#10;    C --&gt; J[C/O比 ~0.5 接近太阳]&#10;    C --&gt; K[金属度 ~10× 太阳]&#10;    C --&gt; L[无/薄云层]&#10;    C --&gt; M[大气混合剧烈]&#10;    G --&gt; N[首次系外行星光化学证据]\">flowchart TD\n    A[WASP-39b 透射光谱] --&gt; B[检测到的分子]\n    A --&gt; C[推断的性质]\n    B --&gt; D[H₂O 多条吸收带]\n    B --&gt; E[CO₂ 4.3 μm 强吸收]\n    B --&gt; F[CO 弱信号]\n    B --&gt; G[SO₂ 光化学产物]\n    B --&gt; H[Na 可见光]\n    B --&gt; I[K 可见光]\n    C --&gt; J[C/O比 ~0.5 接近太阳]\n    C --&gt; K[金属度 ~10× 太阳]\n    C --&gt; L[无/薄云层]\n    C --&gt; M[大气混合剧烈]\n    G --&gt; N[首次系外行星光化学证据]</pre><h3 id=\"k2-18b-争议性的-hycean世界\">K2-18b: 争议性的&quot;Hycean世界&quot;</h3><p>K2-18b（8.6 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，2.6 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，位于宜居带）的 JWST 光谱引发了巨大争议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测到</th>\n<th>未检测到</th>\n<th>推断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CH₄ (~1%)</td>\n<td>CO (&lt;百万分之几)</td>\n<td>还原性大气</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CO₂ (~1%)</td>\n<td>NH₃</td>\n<td>非平衡化学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可能的 DMS?</td>\n<td>H₂O?</td>\n<td>生物标志物?(极初步)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;Hycean世界&quot;假说</strong>：富氢大气下的全球海洋行星。但替代解释（小型海王星无表面海洋）同样可行。需要更多JWST观测才能区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大气检索-atmospheric-retrieval\">大气检索（Atmospheric Retrieval）</h2><h3 id=\"方法论\">方法论</h3><p>从观测光谱推断大气参数是一个逆问题，通常使用贝叶斯方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>代表代码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自由检索</td>\n<td>参数化温度+丰度，MCMC采样</td>\n<td>POSEIDON, petitRADTRANS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网格检索</td>\n<td>预计算光谱网格+内插</td>\n<td>ATMO, Exo-REM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器学习</td>\n<td>训练神经网络加速</td>\n<td>HELA, ExoGAN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自洽模型</td>\n<td>辐射-对流平衡+化学平衡</td>\n<td>PHOENIX, PICASO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"检索参数\">检索参数</h3><p>典型的大气检索拟合以下参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数类</th>\n<th>具体参数</th>\n<th>典型数目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>化学</td>\n<td>各分子混合比</td>\n<td>5-15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>T-P剖面（参数化）</td>\n<td>3-6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云</td>\n<td>云顶压力、灰度/散射</td>\n<td>2-4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行星</td>\n<td>参考半径、质量</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总计</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>10-25</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"简并与挑战\">简并与挑战</h3><p>大气检索面临几类关键简并：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>云-金属度简并</strong>：高层云可模拟低金属度大气的平坦光谱</li>\n<li><strong>温度-丰度简并</strong>：发射光谱中温度和分子丰度部分简并</li>\n<li><strong>平均分子量不确定性</strong>：影响标高从而影响所有丰度推断</li>\n<li><strong>模型假设</strong>：1D 假设忽略昼夜差异和非均匀云</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"不同类型行星的大气特征\">不同类型行星的大气特征</h2><h3 id=\"热木星\">热木星</h3><p>最well-characterized的一类，典型大气成分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度区间</th>\n<th>预期化学</th>\n<th>关键分子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt;2500 K</td>\n<td>原子/离子主导</td>\n<td>Fe, Mg, Ti, TiO, VO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1500-2500 K</td>\n<td>CO/H₂O主导</td>\n<td>H₂O, CO, Na, K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000-1500 K</td>\n<td>CH₄开始出现</td>\n<td>H₂O, CO, CH₄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;1000 K</td>\n<td>CH₄主导碳</td>\n<td>CH₄, H₂O, NH₃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"温暖海王星-亚海王星\">温暖海王星/亚海王星</h3><p>JWST 正在填补这一最常见但最不了解的行星类型的认知空白：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通常有高金属度大气（10-1000× 太阳）</li>\n<li>高层雾/云普遍存在（GJ 1214b 曾是典型&quot;平坦光谱&quot;）</li>\n<li>JWST 终于穿透了 GJ 1214b 的雾层，检测到水和甲烷</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"类地行星\">类地行星</h3><p>最困难也最有价值的目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>JWST能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号极弱</td>\n<td>小半径→小标高→几ppm信号</td>\n<td>边缘可测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高分子量</td>\n<td>CO₂/N₂大气→标高小</td>\n<td>需数十次凌星叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恒星活动</td>\n<td>M矮星黑子/耀斑干扰</td>\n<td>多历元平均抵消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退化</td>\n<td>少量特征→多解</td>\n<td>需多波段互补</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高分辨率光谱技术\">高分辨率光谱技术</h2><h3 id=\"地面高分辨率互补\">地面高分辨率互补</h3><p>地面大望远镜的高色散光谱仪（R~100,000）通过不同原理探测大气分子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交叉相关</td>\n<td>分子模板匹配多条谱线</td>\n<td>检测弱信号分子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多普勒位移</td>\n<td>行星轨道运动导致谱线移动</td>\n<td>分离恒星/行星光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风速测量</td>\n<td>大气环流导致谱线偏移</td>\n<td>动力学约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>已用此方法检测到：CO、H₂O、HCN、Fe、Ti、Ca⁺ 等在热木星大气中的信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"地面-空间协同\">地面+空间协同</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>JWST(空间/低R)</th>\n<th>地面(高R)</th>\n<th>协同价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宽波段连续谱形状</td>\n<td>单条谱线轮廓</td>\n<td>温度+丰度同时约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分子混合比</td>\n<td>大气风速</td>\n<td>完整大气物理图景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云连续不透明度</td>\n<td>穿透云层(仅看清晰谱线核)</td>\n<td>打破云简并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"未来大气表征展望\">未来大气表征展望</h2><h3 id=\"下一代设施\">下一代设施</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设施</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>大气科学能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ELT (39m)</td>\n<td>2028+</td>\n<td>高R光谱+热行星直接光谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ariel (ESA)</td>\n<td>2029</td>\n<td>~1000颗行星的巡天式大气普查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HWO (NASA概念)</td>\n<td>2040s</td>\n<td>类地行星反射光谱(直接成像)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIFE (ESA概念)</td>\n<td>2040s</td>\n<td>中红外干涉→类地行星热辐射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ariel-任务\">Ariel 任务</h3><p>ESA Ariel（2029发射）将执行系外行星大气的首次大规模巡天：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>目标：~1000颗行星的大气光谱</li>\n<li>策略：分层 — 识别(数百颗) → 详细表征(数十颗) → 基准(少数)</li>\n<li>填补：从个案研究到人口统计学</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>系外行星大气表征正经历从&quot;检测时代&quot;到&quot;精确化学时代&quot;的飞跃。JWST 已证明我们能够在远方世界中检测到 CO₂、SO₂、甲烷等分子，甚至追踪光化学和云粒子组成。但对类地行星——最终的生命搜寻目标——的大气表征仍处于极限边缘。TRAPPIST-1 系统的初步结果暗示许多内行星可能已失去大气，而外行星（e、f）仍有希望。未来十年，JWST 的持续观测、Ariel 的统计巡天和 ELT 的高分辨率光谱将共同构建系外行星大气的全面图景，为最终判断何处可能存在生命奠定基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"系外行星大气表征：JWST 时代的光谱革命","id":"系外行星大气表征-jwst-时代的光谱革命"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"大气表征方法","id":"大气表征方法"},{"level":3,"text":"凌星光谱学","id":"凌星光谱学"},{"level":3,"text":"透射光谱原理","id":"透射光谱原理"},{"level":3,"text":"热辐射/二次食光谱","id":"热辐射-二次食光谱"},{"level":3,"text":"相位曲线","id":"相位曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"JWST 的大气表征能力","id":"jwst-的大气表征能力"},{"level":3,"text":"仪器与模式","id":"仪器与模式"},{"level":3,"text":"JWST 系外行星大气里程碑发现（2022-2025）","id":"jwst-系外行星大气里程碑发现-2022-2025"},{"level":3,"text":"WASP-39b: JWST 的首个完整大气肖像","id":"wasp-39b-jwst-的首个完整大气肖像"},{"level":3,"text":"K2-18b: 争议性的\"Hycean世界\"","id":"k2-18b-争议性的-hycean世界"},{"level":2,"text":"大气检索（Atmospheric Retrieval）","id":"大气检索-atmospheric-retrieval"},{"level":3,"text":"方法论","id":"方法论"},{"level":3,"text":"检索参数","id":"检索参数"},{"level":3,"text":"简并与挑战","id":"简并与挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"不同类型行星的大气特征","id":"不同类型行星的大气特征"},{"level":3,"text":"热木星","id":"热木星"},{"level":3,"text":"温暖海王星/亚海王星","id":"温暖海王星-亚海王星"},{"level":3,"text":"类地行星","id":"类地行星"},{"level":2,"text":"高分辨率光谱技术","id":"高分辨率光谱技术"},{"level":3,"text":"地面高分辨率互补","id":"地面高分辨率互补"},{"level":3,"text":"地面+空间协同","id":"地面-空间协同"},{"level":2,"text":"未来大气表征展望","id":"未来大气表征展望"},{"level":3,"text":"下一代设施","id":"下一代设施"},{"level":3,"text":"Ariel 任务","id":"ariel-任务"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"系外行星探测方法：发现其他世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/detection-methods"},"next":{"title":"宜居性与生物标志物：寻找地外生命的科学框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/habitability-biosignatures"}}